    "CatFocus uses Firebase Analytics to understand app usage and Firebase services to deliver and configure notifications. Your focus preferences and training records are stored on this device. Please read the current Privacy Policy online for details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CatFocusはFirebase Analyticsでアプリの利用状況を把握し、Firebaseで通知を配信・設定します。集中の設定やトレーニングの記録は、このデバイスに保存されます。詳しくはウェブ上の最新のプライバシーポリシーをご覧ください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CatFocus는 Firebase Analytics로 앱 이용 현황을 파악하고, Firebase로 알림을 보내고 설정해요. 집중 설정과 훈련 기록은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 자세한 내용은 온라인의 최신 개인정보 처리방침을 확인해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CatFocus 使用 Firebase Analytics 了解應用程式的使用情況，並透過 Firebase 服務傳送與設定通知。你的專注偏好與訓練紀錄儲存在這部裝置上。詳細內容請參閱線上的最新隱私權政策。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CatFocus uses Firebase Analytics to understand app usage and Firebase services to deliver and configure notifications. Your focus preferences and training records are stored on this device. Please read the current Privacy Policy online for details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
