    "LOOK AT ME, BEING RESPONSIBLE.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見て、このまじめなわたし。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "나 봐. 꽤 성실하지?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快看，我也有認真的時候。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LOOK AT ME, BEING RESPONSIBLE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look how far we came. The view is excellent and so is your focus. We should still take a nap, though. — Luna": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "こんなに遠くまで来たんだね。景色も最高だし、あなたの集中力も最高。でも、お昼寝はやっぱり必要だと思う。— ルナ"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "우리가 얼마나 멀리 왔는지 봐. 풍경도 멋지고 네 집중력도 멋져. 그래도 낮잠은 자야겠지? — 루나"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看看我們走了多遠。風景很棒，你的專注力也是。不過，午覺還是要睡的。— Luna"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look how far we came. The view is excellent and so is your focus. We should still take a nap, though. — Luna"
          }
        }
      }
    },
